      "en": "Hathach came and told Esther the words of Mordecai.",
      "ko": "하닥이 돌아와 모르드개의 말을 에스더에게 고하매",
      "source_text_hash": "7ea8c63f93a6f557c7ec7c27132cee6bc4bf26dce34cc11d966709d811e30b58",
      "translation_text_hash": "d466186f5dfa10891b31d62c30cff0bdc28c34e3b01dceb2627fa2401fb09f84",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
