      "en": "Then Esther spoke to Hathach, and gave him a message to Mordecai:",
      "ko": "에스더가 하닥에게 이르되 너는 모르드개에게 고하기를",
      "source_text_hash": "f3c9ab2eec7bfbbda3bb791c40f5e85883143bedf752244ba81259bc648df589",
      "translation_text_hash": "d50a030ede732e889224eb638b2e309fadc13d276114edfbcfcd1a33e85ff9d3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
